<title>USA: Merrill Lynch to study Reeves' alternatives.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch to study Reeves' alternatives.</headline>
<dateline>NORWALK, Conn. 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reeves Industries Inc said Tuesday it retained Merrill Lynch &amp; Co to advise the company in its consideration of strategic alternatives for its primary operating assets.</p>
<p>Reeves said the alternatives incolude the potential sale of the three operating groups -- Reeves Printing Blanket Group, Reeves Advanced Materials Group and Reeves Apparel Textile Group. -- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
